                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">       </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">                        </SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>根据《中共中央、国务院关于全面加强新时代大中小学劳动教育的意见》，要求劳动教育与德育、智育、体育、美育相融合，劳动教育作为新时代</FONT>“五育并举”的重要举措被纳入人才培养全过程。我校紧密结合学校和学生生活实际，努力建设具有绍兴一中特色的劳动教育模式，促进学生形成正确的世界观、人生观、价值观。为此，我校于<FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>月</FONT>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>日组织全体高二师生走进青少年素质教育实践基地</FONT>——诸暨米果果小镇，开展为期一天的劳动实践活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>米果果小镇，是农业农村现代化建设示范基地，也是面向中小学生的劳动实践教育基地。基地以农业自然生态环境为载体，劳动实践教育资源丰富多彩：乡村叙事馆、乡村记忆馆、农业科普馆、果蔬采摘区、土灶体验区、田园大学堂、火龙果主题馆、手工坊等一大批劳动实践教育活动主题馆，从不同维度拓展提升学生的素养。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915321885.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915321885.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>土灶体验知生活乐趣</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>土灶是饮食文化的起源，是利用器械在土地上掘一圆形状坑洼，用石块砌成小型堡垒，在其上方架一口大锅而成。一进入小镇，师生们就来到了土灶体验区。在这里，没有一个厨师，每个人都要利用这一传统的土灶台自己动手、丰衣足食。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>面对陌生的环境，同学们并没有不知所措。他们有序地将准备的食材拿出，把干燥的柴火放入灶堂，洗菜、切菜、掌勺，大家分工明确，配合默契，快乐的声音此起彼伏。没多久，一盘盘美味佳肴被呈了上来。红烧肉肥瘦相间，透着诱人的朱红色，尝一口，松软的肉弹性十足，让人欲罢不能；可乐鸡翅被摆在盘碟中，用葱末作着点缀，还没品尝空气中就弥漫着令人垂涎欲滴的香味，可乐和鸡翅的融合是极富层次感的绝佳组合</FONT>……灶头烧的红红火火，师生们的心也是暖暖和和。大家都说，今天的饭比以前的都要好吃。这里面，饱含了劳动的喜悦和分享的幸福。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915334045.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915334045.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915340525.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915340525.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915344523.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915344523.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915350761.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915350761.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915353620.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915353620.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915360124.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915360124.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>火车观光看乡村振兴</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>土灶体验结束后，同学们就坐上了长长的</FONT>“米果果振兴号”乡村列车。在这列复古又充满童趣的小火车上，同学们乘着十一月份的秋风，穿过秋意蔓延的长廊，沿途说说笑笑，指指点点，在期待与兴奋中细细观赏沿途景致，只见阡陌交通、屋舍俨然，人们怡然自乐，最美的风景在路上……</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>火车的终点站，是观赏天鹅的飞行表演。在带队老师的带领下，同学们都站在石拱桥上耐心等待着天鹅的精彩表演。没过几分钟，成群结队的天鹅从湖面朝我们飞过来，继而展翅从头顶掠过，蔚为壮观，让人仿佛身置如</FONT>“落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色”般的美丽景色之中。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915370739.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915370739.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>大田丰收识农耕文化</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>小火车观光之旅结束后，同学们去了各个展馆和实践劳作区感受体会。在农业科普馆，名目繁多的果实品种，多姿多彩的昆虫标本，形态各异的太空果蔬，见所未见的新鲜绿植，这些让学生们直观感受到现代科学技术对农业生产发展的影响之深之广。在乡村记忆馆，踩高跷、打陀螺、推独轮车、碾捣臼，学生们感受着七八十年代祖父辈最流行的传统民俗游戏和农事劳作方法，领略乡土文化和农耕文化。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在农耕劳作区，学生们下田扛起锄头，亲身体验农业劳动，一个个都不怕苦不怕累，做得有模有样</FONT>……学生们在劳动实践中得到了成长，这也是劳动教育的意义所在。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915380449.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915380449.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915384296.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915384296.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202011/2020111915385649.jpg"><BR><BR></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>    这一次的米果果之行，让学生在做中学，在学中做，对中国的传统文化、农耕文化有了新认知，对中国的乡村振兴战略有了更加全面的认识和体会。虽然学校课程在教育过程中发挥主导作用，但课堂仅仅是劳动教育的操练台、加油站，广阔的、面向真实生活情境的劳动活动才是学生真正的实践场。绍兴一中将继续做好劳动实践教育工作，在实践活动课中通过设计、交流、反思、操练等形式，引导学生在有效的课内学习时间内对接乃至引领日常生活劳动、服务性劳动，开展劳动实践周活动，真正实现自身的全面发展。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">                      </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
